    <md:title>8.6.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>47df568b-975f-4b05-9f9d-6f3f9b96c2b9</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="530bd03b-738e-44f1-9f19-a6c02f63c76c"><problem><para>
      <para>Write \((x + 6)(x + 5)\) in standard form.</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(x^2+10x −30\)</para><para>\(x^2+11x +30\)</para><para>\(x^2+30\)</para><para>\(x^2−11x +30\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(x^2+11x +30\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(x^2+11x +30\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
